  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Expansin del Sistema de Transmisin en Alta Tensin  Fase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the High-voltage Transmission System  Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la segunda operacin es contribuir al desarrollo econmico del pas a travs de un suministro elctrico, confiable y eficiente. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) apoyar la mejora en la confiabilidad y eficiencia del sistema de transmisin en alta tensin; (ii) promover la optimizacin del sistema de transmisin a travs de actualizacin tecnolgica; y (iii) apoyar el desarrollo sostenible del sector elctrico paraguayo a travs de la equidad de gnero y diversidad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the second operation is to contribute to the economic development of the country through a reliable and efficient electricity supply. The specific objectives are: (i) to support improvements in the reliability and efficiency of the high-voltage transmission system; (ii) promote the optimization of the transmission system through technological updating; and (iii) support the sustainable development of the Paraguayan electricity sector through gender equality and diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
